TEI for manuscript description
\section[{Elements}]{Elements}\index{TEI=<TEI>|oddindex}\index{version=@version!<TEI>|oddindex}
\begin{reflist}
\item[]\begin{specHead}{TEI.TEI}{<TEI> }(TEI document) contains a single TEI-conformant document, combining a single TEI header with one or more members of the \textsf{\hyperref[TEI.model.resource]{model.resource}} class. Multiple \hyperref[TEI.TEI]{<TEI>} elements may be combined within a \hyperref[TEI.TEI]{<TEI>} (or \hyperref[TEI.teiCorpus]{<teiCorpus>}) element. [\xref{https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/DS.html\#DS}{4. Default Text Structure} \xref{https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/CC.html\#CCDEF}{16.1. Varieties of Composite Text}]\end{specHead} 
    \item[{Module}]
  textstructure
    \item[{Attributes}]
  \begin{itemize}
\item \hyperref[TEI.att.global]{att.global}\begin{itemize}
\item \textit{@xml:id}
\item \textit{@n}
\item \textit{@xml:lang}
\item \textit{@xml:base}
\item \textit{@xml:space}
\end{itemize} \begin{itemize}
\item \hyperref[TEI.att.global.rendition]{att.global.rendition}\begin{itemize}
\item \textit{@rend}
\item \textit{@style}
\item \textit{@rendition}
\end{itemize} 
\item \hyperref[TEI.att.global.linking]{att.global.linking}\begin{itemize}
\item \textit{@corresp}
\item \textit{@synch}
\item \textit{@sameAs}
\item \textit{@copyOf}
\item \textit{@next}
\item \textit{@prev}
\item \textit{@exclude}
\item \textit{@select}
\end{itemize} 
\item \hyperref[TEI.att.global.analytic]{att.global.analytic}\begin{itemize}
\item \textit{@ana}
\end{itemize} 
\item \hyperref[TEI.att.global.facs]{att.global.facs}\begin{itemize}
\item \textit{@facs}
\end{itemize} 
\item \hyperref[TEI.att.global.change]{att.global.change}\begin{itemize}
\item \textit{@change}
\end{itemize} 
\item \hyperref[TEI.att.global.responsibility]{att.global.responsibility}\begin{itemize}
\item \textit{@cert}
\item \textit{@resp}
\end{itemize} 
\item \hyperref[TEI.att.global.source]{att.global.source}\begin{itemize}
\item \textit{@source}
\end{itemize} 
\end{itemize} 
\item \hyperref[TEI.att.typed]{att.typed}\begin{itemize}
\item \textit{@type}
\item \textit{@subtype}
\end{itemize} 
\end{itemize} \hfil\\[-10pt]\begin{sansreflist}
    \item[@version]
  specifies the version number of the TEI Guidelines against which this document is valid.
\begin{reflist}
    \item[{Status}]
  Optional
    \item[{Datatype}]
  \hyperref[TEI.teidata.version]{teidata.version}
    \item[{Note}]
  \par
Major editions of the Guidelines have long been informally referred to by a name made up of the letter P (for Proposal) followed by a digit. The current release is one of the many releases of the fifth major edition of the Guidelines, known as P5. This attribute may be used to associate a TEI document with a specific release of the P5 Guidelines, in the absence of a more precise association provided by the {\itshape source} attribute on the associated \texttt{<schemaSpec>}.
\end{reflist}  
\end{sansreflist}  
    \item[{Member of}]
  \hyperref[TEI.model.describedResource]{model.describedResource}
    \item[{Contained by}]
  
    \item[core: ]
   \hyperref[TEI.teiCorpus]{teiCorpus}\par 
    \item[textstructure: ]
   \hyperref[TEI.TEI]{TEI}
    \item[{May contain}]
  
    \item[header: ]
   \hyperref[TEI.teiHeader]{teiHeader}\par 
    \item[linking: ]
   \hyperref[TEI.standOff]{standOff}\par 
    \item[textstructure: ]
   \hyperref[TEI.TEI]{TEI} \hyperref[TEI.text]{text}\par 
    \item[transcr: ]
   \hyperref[TEI.facsimile]{facsimile} \hyperref[TEI.sourceDoc]{sourceDoc}
    \item[{Note}]
  \par
This element is required. It is customary to specify the TEI namespace \textsf{http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0} on it, for example: <TEI version="4.4.0" xml:lang="it" xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">.
    \item[{Example}]
  \leavevmode\bgroup\exampleFont \begin{shaded}\noindent\mbox{}{<\textbf{TEI}\hspace*{6pt}{version}="{3.3.0}" xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{teiHeader}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{fileDesc}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{titleStmt}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{title}>}The shortest TEI Document Imaginable{</\textbf{title}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{titleStmt}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{publicationStmt}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{p}>}First published as part of TEI P2, this is the P5\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt} version using a namespace.{</\textbf{p}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{publicationStmt}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{sourceDesc}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{p}>}No source: this is an original work.{</\textbf{p}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{sourceDesc}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{fileDesc}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{teiHeader}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{text}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{body}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{p}>}This is about the shortest TEI document imaginable.{</\textbf{p}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{body}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{text}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{TEI}>}\end{shaded}\egroup 


    \item[{Example}]
  \leavevmode\bgroup\exampleFont \begin{shaded}\noindent\mbox{}{<\textbf{TEI}\hspace*{6pt}{version}="{2.9.1}" xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{teiHeader}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{fileDesc}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{titleStmt}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{title}>}A TEI Document containing four page images {</\textbf{title}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{titleStmt}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{publicationStmt}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{p}>}Unpublished demonstration file.{</\textbf{p}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{publicationStmt}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{sourceDesc}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{p}>}No source: this is an original work.{</\textbf{p}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{sourceDesc}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{fileDesc}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{teiHeader}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{facsimile}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{graphic}\hspace*{6pt}{url}="{page1.png}"/>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{graphic}\hspace*{6pt}{url}="{page2.png}"/>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{graphic}\hspace*{6pt}{url}="{page3.png}"/>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{graphic}\hspace*{6pt}{url}="{page4.png}"/>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{facsimile}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{TEI}>}\end{shaded}\egroup 


    \item[{Schematron}]
   <sch:ns prefix="tei"  uri="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"/> <sch:ns prefix="xs"  uri="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"/>
    \item[{Schematron}]
   <sch:ns prefix="rng"  uri="http://relaxng.org/ns/structure/1.0"/> <sch:ns prefix="rna"  uri="http://relaxng.org/ns/compatibility/annotations/1.0"/>
