    \item[@scheme]
  identifies the classification scheme within which the set of categories concerned is defined, for example by a \hyperref[TEI.taxonomy]{<taxonomy>} element, or by some other resource.
\begin{reflist}
    \item[{Status}]
  Optional
    \item[{Datatype}]
  \hyperref[TEI.teidata.pointer]{teidata.pointer}
\end{reflist}  
\end{sansreflist}  
