\begin{reflist}
\item[]\begin{specHead}{TEI.citeStructure}{<citeStructure> }(citation structure) declares a structure and method for citing the current document. [\xref{https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/CO.html\#CORS6}{3.11.4. Declaring Reference Systems} \xref{https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/SA.html\#SACRCS}{17.2.5.4. Citation Structures}]\end{specHead} 
    \item[{Module}]
  header
    \item[{Attributes}]
  \begin{itemize}
\item \hyperref[TEI.att.global]{att.global}\begin{itemize}
