    \item[transcr: ]
   \hyperref[TEI.metamark]{metamark} \hyperref[TEI.supplied]{supplied}
    \item[{Note}]
  \par
Unlike \hyperref[TEI.gap]{<gap>}, which indicates content that the encoder cannot or chooses not to represent, \hyperref[TEI.ellipsis]{<ellipsis>} indicates a passage explicitly signalled in the source document as absent. The \hyperref[TEI.ellipsis]{<ellipsis>} element is not appropriate for every use of ellipsis points, such as when they indicate that a speaker is pausing.
    \item[{Example}]
  \leavevmode\bgroup\exampleFont \begin{shaded}\noindent\mbox{}{<\textbf{lg}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}What projects men make—what queer turns they take,{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}Since {<\textbf{emph}>}steam{</\textbf{emph}>} has improved our condition;{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}They never are still, but must cure or must kill{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}With steam physic or steam ammunition.{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}But a short time ago, to a quack you would go,{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}To steam a fat man to a thinner;{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}Now changed from all that, if you wish to get {<\textbf{emph}>}fat{</\textbf{emph}>},{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}Come to Barton’s and eat a {<\textbf{emph}>}steam dinner!{</\textbf{emph}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}Oh dear! think of a scheme, odd though it seem—{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}I’m sure ’twill succeed if you make it by steam.{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{lg}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{<\textbf{lg}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}You may sleep, you may dream, you may travel by steam,{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}For the outcry is still to go faster;{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}And what does it reck, should you e’en break your neck,{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}If ’tis {<\textbf{emph}>}steam{</\textbf{emph}>} that brings on the disaster?{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{ellipsis}\hspace*{6pt}{resp}="{\#ChambersEdnbrghJrnl1880}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{metamark}\hspace*{6pt}{function}="{multilineEllipsis}">} * * * * {</\textbf{metamark}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{desc}\hspace*{6pt}{resp}="{\#teiProjectEditor2021}">}The printer omits four lines here,\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt} skipping the second half of the second octave, before the refrain.{</\textbf{desc}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{ellipsis}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}Oh dear! think of a scheme, odd though it seem—{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}I’m sure ’twill succeed if you make it by steam.{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{lg}>}\end{shaded}\egroup 


    \item[{Example}]
  \leavevmode\bgroup\exampleFont \begin{shaded}\noindent\mbox{}{<\textbf{lg}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}You think you’ve lost your love {</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}Well, I saw her yesterday {</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}It’s you she's thinking of {</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}And she told me what to say{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{lg}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{<\textbf{lg}\hspace*{6pt}{xml:id}="{chorus}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{label}>}[Refrain]{</\textbf{label}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}She says she loves you {</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}And you know that can’t be bad {</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}Yes, she loves you {</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}And you know you should be glad{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{lg}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{<\textbf{lg}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}She said you hurt her so {</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}She almost lost her mind {</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}But now she said she knows {</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{l}>}You’re not the hurting kind{</\textbf{l}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{lg}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{<\textbf{ellipsis}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{metamark}>}******{</\textbf{metamark}>}\mbox{}\newline 
