    \item[{Note}]
  \par
This element is intended for use as an alternative to the content of its parent \hyperref[TEI.figure]{<figure>} element ; for example, to display when the image is required but the equipment in use cannot display graphic images. It may also be used for indexing or documentary purposes.
    \item[{Example}]
