\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{handNote}\hspace*{6pt}{scope}="{major}">}Written throughout in {<\textbf{term}>}angelicana formata{</\textbf{term}>}.{</\textbf{handNote}>}\mbox{}\newline 
