\item[]\begin{specHead}{TEI.listPrefixDef}{<listPrefixDef> }(list of prefix definitions) contains a list of definitions of prefixing schemes used in \textsf{teidata.pointer} values, showing how abbreviated URIs using each scheme may be expanded into full URIs. [\xref{https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/SA.html\#SAPU}{17.2.3. Using Abbreviated Pointers}]\end{specHead} 
    \item[{Module}]
  header
    \item[{Attributes}]
  \begin{itemize}
\item \hyperref[TEI.att.global]{att.global}\begin{itemize}
\item \textit{@xml:id}
