    \item[namesdates: ]
   \hyperref[TEI.listRelation]{listRelation} \hyperref[TEI.relation]{relation}
    \item[{Note}]
  \par
May contain a prose description organized as paragraphs, or a sequence of \hyperref[TEI.relation]{<relation>} elements.
    \item[{Example}]
  \leavevmode\bgroup\exampleFont \begin{shaded}\noindent\mbox{}{<\textbf{listPerson}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{person}\hspace*{6pt}{xml:id}="{pp1}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\textit{<!-- data about person pp1 -->}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{person}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{person}\hspace*{6pt}{xml:id}="{pp2}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\textit{<!-- data about person pp1 -->}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{person}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\textit{<!-- more person (pp3, pp4) elements here -->}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{listRelation}\hspace*{6pt}{type}="{personal}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{relation}\hspace*{6pt}{active}="{\#pp1 \#pp2}"\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{name}="{parent}"\hspace*{6pt}{passive}="{\#pp3 \#pp4}"/>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{relation}\hspace*{6pt}{mutual}="{\#pp1 \#pp2}"\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{name}="{spouse}"/>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{listRelation}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{listRelation}\hspace*{6pt}{type}="{social}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{relation}\hspace*{6pt}{active}="{\#pp1}"\hspace*{6pt}{name}="{employer}"\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{passive}="{\#pp3 \#pp5 \#pp6 \#pp7}"/>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{listRelation}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{listPerson}>}\end{shaded}\egroup 

The persons with identifiers pp1 and pp2 are the parents of pp3 and pp4; they are also married to each other; pp1 is the employer of pp3, pp5, pp6, and pp7.
    \item[{Example}]
  \leavevmode\bgroup\exampleFont \begin{shaded}\noindent\mbox{}{<\textbf{listPerson}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{person}\hspace*{6pt}{xml:id}="{en\textunderscore pp1}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\textit{<!-- data about person en\textunderscore pp1 -->}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{person}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{person}\hspace*{6pt}{xml:id}="{en\textunderscore pp2}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\textit{<!-- data about person en\textunderscore pp2 -->}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{person}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\textit{<!-- more person (en\textunderscore pp3, en\textunderscore pp4) elements here -->}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{listPerson}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{<\textbf{listPlace}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{place}\hspace*{6pt}{xml:id}="{en\textunderscore pl1}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\textit{<!-- data about place en\textunderscore pl1 -->}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{place}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\textit{<!-- more place (en\textunderscore pl2, en\textunderscore pl3) elements here -->}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{listPlace}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{<\textbf{listRelation}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{relation}\hspace*{6pt}{active}="{\#en\textunderscore pp1 \#en\textunderscore pp2}"\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{name}="{residence}"\hspace*{6pt}{passive}="{\#en\textunderscore pl1}"/>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{listRelation}>}\end{shaded}\egroup 

The persons with identifiers en\textunderscore pp1 and en\textunderscore pp2 live in en\textunderscore pl1.
    \item[{Example}]
  \leavevmode\bgroup\exampleFont \begin{shaded}\noindent\mbox{}{<\textbf{listRelation}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{p}>}All speakers are members of the Ceruli family, born in Naples.{</\textbf{p}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{listRelation}>}\end{shaded}\egroup 


