\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{unit}="{count}">}500\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt} words{</\textbf{measure}>}. This presentation type is suitable for\mbox{}\newline 
 substantial research, theoretical or critical discussions.{</\textbf{p}>}\end{shaded}\egroup 


