    \item[core: ]
   \hyperref[TEI.desc]{desc} \hyperref[TEI.note]{note} \hyperref[TEI.noteGrp]{noteGrp}
    \item[{Example}]
  In the following example, there are two notes in different languages, each specifying the content of the annotation relating to the same fragment of text:\leavevmode\bgroup\exampleFont \begin{shaded}\noindent\mbox{}{<\textbf{p}>}(...) tamen reuerendos dominos archiepiscopum et canonicos Leopolienses\mbox{}\newline 
 necnon episcopum in duplicibus Quatuortemporibus\mbox{}\newline 
{<\textbf{noteGrp}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{note}\hspace*{6pt}{xml:lang}="{en}">}Quatuor Tempora, so called dry fast days (Wednesday, Friday, and Saturday)\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt} falling on each of the quarters of the year. In the first quarter they were called Cinerum\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt} (following Ash Wednesday), second Spiritus (following Pentecost), third Crucis\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt} (after the Exaltation of the Holy Cross, September 14th), and Luciae\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt} in the fourth (after the feast of St. Lucia, December 13th).\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{note}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{note}\hspace*{6pt}{xml:lang}="{pl}">}Quatuor Tempora, tzw. Suche dni postne (środa, piątek i sobota)\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt} przypadające cztery razy w roku. W pierwszym kwartale zwały się Cinerum\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt} (po Popielcu), w drugim Spiritus (po Zielonych Świętach), w trzecim Crucis\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt} (po święcie Podwyższenia Krzyża 14 września), w czwartym Luciae\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt} (po dniu św. Łucji 13 grudnia).\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{note}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{noteGrp}>}\mbox{}\newline 
 totaliter expediui.\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{p}>}\end{shaded}\egroup 


