    \item[{Example}]
  Example encoding of the German sentence \textit{Wir fahren in den Urlaub.}, encoded with attributes from \textsf{\hyperref[TEI.att.linguistic]{att.linguistic}} discussed in section AILALW.\leavevmode\bgroup\exampleFont \begin{shaded}\noindent\mbox{}{<\textbf{s}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{w}\hspace*{6pt}{msd}="{1.Pl.*.Nom}"\hspace*{6pt}{pos}="{PPER}">}Wir{</\textbf{w}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{w}\hspace*{6pt}{msd}="{1.Pl.Pres.Ind}"\hspace*{6pt}{pos}="{VVFIN}">}fahren{</\textbf{w}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{w}\hspace*{6pt}{msd}="{--}"\hspace*{6pt}{pos}="{APPR}">}in{</\textbf{w}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{w}\hspace*{6pt}{msd}="{Def.Masc.Akk.Sg.}"\hspace*{6pt}{pos}="{ART}">}den{</\textbf{w}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{w}\hspace*{6pt}{msd}="{Masc.Akk.Sg.}"\hspace*{6pt}{pos}="{NN}">}Urlaub{</\textbf{w}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{pc}\hspace*{6pt}{join}="{left}"\hspace*{6pt}{msd}="{--}"\hspace*{6pt}{pos}="{\$.}">}.{</\textbf{pc}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{s}>}\end{shaded}\egroup 


