\item[]\begin{specHead}{TEI.provenance}{<provenance> }(provenance) contains any descriptive or other information concerning a single identifiable episode during the history of a manuscript, manuscript part, or other object after its creation but before its acquisition. [\xref{https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/MS.html\#mshy}{11.8. History}]\end{specHead} 
