\begin{reflist}
\item[]\begin{specHead}{TEI.relation}{<relation> }(relationship) describes any kind of relationship or linkage amongst a specified group of places, events, persons, objects or other items. [\xref{https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/ND.html\#NDPERSREL}{14.3.2.3. Personal Relationships}]\end{specHead} 
