{<\textbf{p}>}Θερινὴ τροπή\mbox{}\newline 
{<\textbf{lb}/>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{foreign}\hspace*{6pt}{xml:id}="{mp0a8}"\hspace*{6pt}{xml:lang}="{hbo}">} ת\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{supplied}\hspace*{6pt}{reason}="{undefined}">}קו{</\textbf{supplied}>}\mbox{}\newline 
