    \item[{Example}]
  In this (partially fictional) example an initial encoder (‘across.dta’) encoded most of the document; a later encoder (‘rcapolung.ewo’) encoded a particular passage; and a third encoder (‘sbauman.emt’) fixed some of that encoding.\leavevmode\bgroup\exampleFont \begin{shaded}\noindent\mbox{}\mbox{}\newline 
\textit{<!-- in the <teiHeader>: -->}{<\textbf{respStmt}\hspace*{6pt}{xml:id}="{enc03}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{persName}\hspace*{6pt}{ref}="{../contextual/persons.xml\#across.dta}"/>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{resp}>}encoding{</\textbf{resp}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{respStmt}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\textit{<!-- in the <text>: -->}\mbox{}\newline 
{<\textbf{spGrp}\hspace*{6pt}{rend}="{braced(atonce1)}"\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{xml:id}="{sgrp05}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{sp}\hspace*{6pt}{who}="{\#mo}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{speaker}\hspace*{6pt}{rend}="{align(left)slant(italic)}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{persName}>}Mor{</\textbf{persName}>}.{</\textbf{speaker}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{p}\hspace*{6pt}{rend}="{break(no)}">}So, so, so!{</\textbf{p}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{sp}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{sp}\hspace*{6pt}{who}="{\#hg}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{speaker}\hspace*{6pt}{rend}="{align(left)slant(italic)}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{persName}>}Mr. H{</\textbf{persName}>}.{</\textbf{speaker}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{p}\hspace*{6pt}{rend}="{break(no)}">}What, without my Leave!{</\textbf{p}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{sp}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{sp}\hspace*{6pt}{who}="{\#la}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{speaker}\hspace*{6pt}{rend}="{align(left)slant(italic)}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{persName}>}Lady D{</\textbf{persName}>}.{</\textbf{speaker}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{p}\hspace*{6pt}{rend}="{break(no)}">}Amazing!{</\textbf{p}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{sp}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{spGrp}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{<\textbf{stage}\hspace*{6pt}{rend}="{align(right)slant(italic)}"\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{type}="{delivery}"\hspace*{6pt}{xml:id}="{atonce1}">}All together.{</\textbf{stage}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\textit{<!-- anywhere: -->}\mbox{}\newline 
{<\textbf{respons}\hspace*{6pt}{locus}="{name}"\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{resp}="{../contextual/persons.xml\#rcapolung.ewo}"\hspace*{6pt}{target}="{sgrp05}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{desc}>}Ashley did not know what to do with this; I have decided it\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt} best fits as a braced {<\textbf{gi}>}spGrp{</\textbf{gi}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{desc}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{respons}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{<\textbf{respons}\hspace*{6pt}{locus}="{value}"\hspace*{6pt}{match}="{.//@rend}"\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{resp}="{../contextual/persons.xml\#sbauman.emt}"\hspace*{6pt}{target}="{sgrp05}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{desc}>}fixed {<\textbf{att}>}rend{</\textbf{att}>} attributes{</\textbf{desc}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{respons}>}\end{shaded}\egroup 


