    \item[{Example}]
  This example shows an encoding of contextual information which is referred to from the main text.\leavevmode\bgroup\exampleFont \begin{shaded}\noindent\mbox{}{<\textbf{TEI} xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{teiHeader}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\textit{<!-- ... -->}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{teiHeader}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{standOff}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{listPlace}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{place}\hspace*{6pt}{xml:id}="{LATL}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{placeName}>}Atlanta{</\textbf{placeName}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{location}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{region}\hspace*{6pt}{key}="{US-GA}">}Georgia{</\textbf{region}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{country}\hspace*{6pt}{key}="{USA}">}United States of America{</\textbf{country}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{geo}>}33.755 -84.39{</\textbf{geo}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{location}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{population}\hspace*{6pt}{quantity}="{489359}"\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{source}="{https://www.biggestuscities.com/city/atlanta-georgia}"\hspace*{6pt}{type}="{interpolatedCensus}"\hspace*{6pt}{when}="{1963}"/>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{place}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{place}\hspace*{6pt}{xml:id}="{LBHM}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{placeName}>}Birmingham{</\textbf{placeName}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{location}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{region}\hspace*{6pt}{key}="{US-AL}">}Alabama{</\textbf{region}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{country}\hspace*{6pt}{key}="{USA}">}United States of America{</\textbf{country}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{geo}>}33.653333 -86.808889{</\textbf{geo}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{location}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{population}\hspace*{6pt}{quantity}="{332891}"\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{source}="{https://www.biggestuscities.com/city/birmingham-alabama}"\hspace*{6pt}{type}="{interpolatedCensus}"\hspace*{6pt}{when}="{1963}"/>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{place}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{listPlace}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{standOff}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{text}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{body}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\textit{<!-- ... -->}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{p}>}Moreover, I am {<\textbf{choice}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{sic}>}congnizant{</\textbf{sic}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{corr}>}cognizant{</\textbf{corr}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{choice}>} of the interrelatedness of all communities and\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{lb}/>}states. I cannot sit idly by in {<\textbf{placeName}\hspace*{6pt}{ref}="{\#LATL}">}Atlanta{</\textbf{placeName}>} and not be concerned about what happens\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{lb}/>}in {<\textbf{placeName}\hspace*{6pt}{ref}="{\#LBHM}">}Birmingham{</\textbf{placeName}>}. {<\textbf{seg}\hspace*{6pt}{xml:id}="{FQ17}">}Injustice anywhere is a threat to justice everywhere.{</\textbf{seg}>} We\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{lb}/>}are caught in an inescapable network of mutuality, tied in a single garment\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{lb}/>}of destiny. Whatever affects one directly affects all indirectly. Never\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{lb}/>}again can we afford to live with the narrow, provincial {<\textbf{soCalled}\hspace*{6pt}{rendition}="{\#Rqms}">}outside agitator{</\textbf{soCalled}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{lb}/>}idea. Anyone who lives inside the United States can never be considered\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{lb}/>}an outsider anywhere in this country.{</\textbf{p}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\textit{<!-- ... -->}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{body}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{text}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{TEI}>}\end{shaded}\egroup 


