\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{gramGrp}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{def}>}the state when one's feelings and actions are uncontrolled; freedom from\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt} control{</\textbf{def}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{</\textbf{entry}>}\mbox{}\newline 
