The \hyperref[TEI.damage]{<damage>}, \hyperref[TEI.gap]{<gap>}, \hyperref[TEI.del]{<del>}, \hyperref[TEI.unclear]{<unclear>} and \hyperref[TEI.supplied]{<supplied>} elements may be closely allied in use. See section \xref{https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/PH.html\#PHCOMB}{12.3.3.2. Use of the gap, del, damage, unclear, and supplied Elements in Combination} for discussion of which element is appropriate for which circumstance.
