    \item[@type]
  classifies the title page according to any convenient typology.
\begin{reflist}
    \item[{Derived from}]
  \hyperref[TEI.att.typed]{att.typed}
    \item[{Status}]
  Optional
    \item[{Datatype}]
  \hyperref[TEI.teidata.enumerated]{teidata.enumerated}
    \item[{Note}]
  \par
This attribute allows the same element to be used for volume title pages, series title pages, etc., as well as for the ‘main’ title page of a work.
\end{reflist}  
