\begin{reflist}
\item[]\begin{specHead}{TEI.transpose}{<transpose> }describes a single textual transposition as an ordered list of at least two pointers specifying the order in which the elements indicated should be re-combined. [\xref{https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/PH.html\#transpo}{12.3.4.5. Transpositions}]\end{specHead} 
    \item[{Module}]
  transcr
    \item[{Attributes}]
  \begin{itemize}
\item \hyperref[TEI.att.global]{att.global}\begin{itemize}
\item \textit{@xml:id}
\item \textit{@n}
