    \item[{Note}]
  \par
The \hyperref[TEI.witDetail]{<witDetail>} element was formerly permitted anywhere that \hyperref[TEI.note]{<note>} could appear, but since it should only be used in association with \hyperref[TEI.lem]{<lem>} and \hyperref[TEI.rdg]{<rdg>}, it is recommended that it be placed immediately following the reading that it modifies, in the same \hyperref[TEI.app]{<app>}. A \hyperref[TEI.witDetail]{<witDetail>} without a {\itshape target} attribute should be assumed to refer to the closest preceding \hyperref[TEI.lem]{<lem>} or \hyperref[TEI.rdg]{<rdg>}.
    \item[{Example}]
  \leavevmode\bgroup\exampleFont \begin{shaded}\noindent\mbox{}{<\textbf{app}\hspace*{6pt}{type}="{substantive}">}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{lem}\hspace*{6pt}{wit}="{\#El \#HG}"\hspace*{6pt}{xml:id}="{W026x}">}Experience{</\textbf{lem}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{rdg}\hspace*{6pt}{wit}="{\#Ha4}">}Experiens{</\textbf{rdg}>}\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}{<\textbf{witDetail}\hspace*{6pt}{resp}="{\#PR}"\hspace*{6pt}{target}="{\#W026x}"\mbox{}\newline 
\hspace*{6pt}\hspace*{6pt}{type}="{presentation}"\hspace*{6pt}{wit}="{\#El}">}Ornamental capital.{</\textbf{witDetail}>}\mbox{}\newline 
{</\textbf{app}>}\end{shaded}\egroup 


