    \item[{Note}]
  \par
May contain character data and phrase-level elements; usually contains a \hyperref[TEI.ref]{<ref>} or a \hyperref[TEI.ptr]{<ptr>} element.\par
This element encloses both the actual indication of the location referred to, which may be tagged using the \hyperref[TEI.ref]{<ref>} or \hyperref[TEI.ptr]{<ptr>} elements, and any accompanying material which gives more information about why the reader is being referred there.
