\item[]\begin{specHead}{TEI.model.titlepagePart}{model.titlepagePart}\index{model.titlepagePart (model class)|oddindex} groups elements which can occur as direct constituents of a title page, such as \hyperref[TEI.docTitle]{<docTitle>}, \hyperref[TEI.docAuthor]{<docAuthor>}, \hyperref[TEI.docImprint]{<docImprint>}, or \hyperref[TEI.epigraph]{<epigraph>}. [\xref{https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/DS.html\#DSTITL}{4.6. Title Pages}]\end{specHead} 
