\end{reflist}  
    \item[@nymRef]
  (reference to the canonical name) provides a means of locating the canonical form (\textit{nym}) of the names associated with the object named by the element bearing it.
\begin{reflist}
    \item[{Status}]
  Optional
    \item[{Datatype}]
