    \item[{Note}]
  \par
Values for attributes using this datatype may be defined locally by a project, or they may refer to an external standard.\par
Values for this datatype should not be used to encode morphological gender (cf. \hyperref[TEI.gen]{<gen>}, {\itshape msd} as defined in \textsf{\hyperref[TEI.att.linguistic]{att.linguistic}}, and \xref{https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/DI.html\#DITPFO}{10.3.1. Information on Written and Spoken Forms}).
