Attributes using this datatype must contain a single word which follows the rules defining a legal XML name (see \url{https://www.w3.org/TR/REC-xml/\#dt-name}): for example they cannot include whitespace or begin with digits.
\end{reflist}  
\begin{reflist}
\item[]\begin{specHead}{TEI.teidata.namespace}{teidata.namespace} defines the range of attribute values used to indicate XML namespaces as defined by the W3C \xref{https://www.w3.org/TR/1999/REC-xml-names-19990114/}{Namespaces in XML} Technical Recommendation.\end{specHead} 
